WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.293 --> 00:00:18.956
and Mandy followed the boy out of the storage room and through another door.

2
00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:23.339
"Whoa!" Vinnie exclaimed.

3
00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.042
They were in a large, spacious room with a high ceiling.

4
00:00:29.483 --> 00:00:33.809
In one corner, sunlight poured into the room through big windows.

5
00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:39.352
Young artists sat looking at a woman posing in a red robe.

6
00:00:40.492 --> 00:00:42.973
They made sketches of her in their notebooks.

7
00:00:44.213 --> 00:00:47.935
In another part of the room, some boys were painting shields.

8
00:00:49.476 --> 00:00:50.896
Others were painting chests.

9
00:00:52.037 --> 00:00:54.337
The workshop was busy with activity.

10
00:00:54.357 --> 00:00:57.579
"Hey, Leo, who are your friends?"

11
00:00:58.739 --> 00:01:00.280
asked a boy with dark hair.

12
00:01:01.536 --> 00:01:02.537
He came up to them.

13
00:01:03.678 --> 00:01:05.819
He had some blue paint on his cheek.

14
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.502
Vinnie and Mandy introduced themselves.

15
00:01:09.522 --> 00:01:13.445
"My name is Sandro," said the boy.

16
00:01:14.505 --> 00:01:16.046
Then he turned to his friend.

17
00:01:16.066 --> 00:01:20.009
"You know the rules, Leo," said Sandro.

18
00:01:20.029 --> 00:01:22.911
"Work to create and create to work.

19
00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:25.113
That means no visitors.

20
00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:29.216
If Master Verrocchio finds out, you're in trouble."

21
00:01:30.616 --> 00:01:33.338
"They are new to Florence," replied Leo.

22
00:01:33.358 --> 00:01:36.259
"I promised to show them around.

23
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:39.061
I'm sure the master won't mind."

24
00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:46.805
Mandy shouted, clapping her hands loudly.

25
00:01:48.005 --> 00:01:50.427
She had always wanted to visit Italy.

26
00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:53.889
Several people stopped and looked at her.

27
00:01:53.909 --> 00:01:59.752
"Mandy, people are staring at you," Vinnie whispered.

28
00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:04.078
Suddenly everyone turned to look at the door.

29
00:02:05.299 --> 00:02:07.300
A tall, older man came in.

30
00:02:08.421 --> 00:02:11.824
He was dressed in a black robe that covered a blue tunic.

31
00:02:12.784 --> 00:02:14.005
He wore a black hat.

32
00:02:14.025 --> 00:02:17.928
"Why am I hearing talking and not creating?"

33
00:02:18.468 --> 00:02:19.609
he asked loudly.

34
00:02:19.629 --> 00:02:22.050
"Master Verrocchio?

35
00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:27.334
Our new student here has brought some friends to visit," said Sandro.

36
00:02:27.354 --> 00:02:29.776
"Is that so?"

37
00:02:30.236 --> 00:02:31.657
Master Verrochhio said.

38
00:02:32.758 --> 00:02:33.998
He walked over to them.

39
00:02:34.018 --> 00:02:37.020
"I was just outside the workshop.

40
00:02:38.061 --> 00:02:39.622
I didn't see anyone come in.

41
00:02:40.683 --> 00:02:41.823
How did you get inside?"

42
00:02:42.824 --> 00:02:44.365
He glared at the children.

43
00:02:45.746 --> 00:02:51.809
Before they could answer, Leo said, "Sir, I take full responsibility for them.

44
00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.390
They were lost.

45
00:02:54.451 --> 00:02:55.592
I thought I could help them."

46
00:02:56.688 --> 00:03:00.210
Master Verrocchio's face softened as he looked at Leo.

47
00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:02.892
"Did you finish the drafts I wanted?"

48
00:03:03.352 --> 00:03:03.872
he asked.

49
00:03:05.313 --> 00:03:07.454
Leo handed him a stack of paper.

50
00:03:08.675 --> 00:03:10.936
Master Verrocchio studied the drawings.

51
00:03:12.137 --> 00:03:14.838
To Vinnie, they looked like computer drawings.

52
00:03:15.979 --> 00:03:18.160
The lines were so straight and precise.

53
00:03:19.361 --> 00:03:21.702
Master Verrocchio nodded with approval.

54
00:03:21.722 --> 00:03:24.744
"You have a gift," he said.

55
00:03:25.824 --> 00:03:27.646
"Your talent is already being noticed."

56
00:03:28.827 --> 00:03:32.430
Master Verrocchio handed Leo a soft leather folder.

57
00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:36.393
"Inside are plans for work at the Medici Palace.

58
00:03:37.534 --> 00:03:40.116
The lord's son has requested you to bring them to him."

59
00:03:41.497 --> 00:03:43.899
"But, sir," Sandro protested.

60
00:03:43.919 --> 00:03:46.642
"I was supposed to deliver them."

61
00:03:46.662 --> 00:03:51.085
"Young Lorenzo wants Leo," Master Verrocchio said.

62
00:03:52.186 --> 00:03:56.971
Nodding to Leo, he said, "Return here after delivering the plans."

63
00:03:56.991 --> 00:04:03.441
"Yes, sir," Leo replied respectfully, taking his notebook and pencil.

64
00:04:04.582 --> 00:04:08.288
Leo bowed and left the workshop with Vinnie and Mandy.
